# Long Feng, Grand Secretariat: it triggers once for each other creature or land of yours that goes to a graveyard, also at the same time
# (CR 603.2, 603.10a). Bot2's Pyroclasm (2 damage to each creature) kills Bot1's Memnite and Ornithopter together but not the 2/3 Long Feng,
# so two triggers go on the stack and each puts a +1/+1 counter on the Long Feng (4/5); Bot2's own Memnite dying too adds nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Long Feng, Grand Secretariat
Memnite
Ornithopter
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Pyroclasm
Mountain x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Long Feng, Grand Secretariat.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Pyroclasm.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Long Feng, Grand Secretariat.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Long Feng, Grand Secretariat.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Long Feng, Grand Secretariat.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Memnite
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite; Pyroclasm
